	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_middleman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あさは　おなかが　へったと
ポケモンが　おこしに　くる▼
よるは　あそびつかれた
ポケモンが　ベッドを　ひとりじめ▼
ことばに　してみると　ひどいけど
おれは　これが　うれしいんだよなあ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:46:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>朝は　おなかが　減ったと
ポケモンが　起こしに　くる▼
夜は　遊びつかれた
ポケモンが　ベッドを　独り占め▼
言葉に　してみると　ひどいけど
おれは　これが　うれしいんだよなあ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:46:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_oldman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？？？ぼくじょう　だがな
やせいポケモンも　とびだすんじゃぞ！▼
そりゃもう　じぶんの　ポケモンだけが
たより　っちゅー　ぐらいにな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:24:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？？？牧場　だがな
野生のポケモンも　飛びだすんじゃぞ！▼
そりゃもう　自分の　ポケモンだけが
頼り　っちゅー　ぐらいにな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:24:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・仮メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:18:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_girl1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これまでに　やったことを
わすれないように　きろくするため▽
レポートを　かいているの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:17:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これまでに　やったことを
忘れないように　記録するため
レポートを　書いているの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:18:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:18:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_boy1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どんなときでも　かこと　みらいは
すてきに　おもえるけどー▼
ポケモンと　あそんでいる　じかんは
いま　なんだよねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:33:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どんなときでも　過去と　未来は
ステキに　思えるけどー▼
ポケモンと　遊んでいる　時間は
今　なんだよねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:33:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・時計台について</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T03:33:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06_woman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたは　ひらがな　よりも
かんじの　ほうが　すきなのかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたは　漢字よりも
ひらがなのほうが　好きなのかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はいだと文字モード切替
・BWでt01にいた女性</Comment>
